# Raw source frame sequences for the site's scroll-scrubbed sections — each
# is a disposable intermediate (hundreds of MB of full-size PNGs) that gets
# converted to a much smaller WebP sequence under web/public/ by a one-off
# script (see web/scripts/convert-*-frames.mjs); that converted output is
# what the site actually serves and is what's committed, not these.
choose-your-escape-frames/
Hero-page-entrance-frames/
